parkingAtlas.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: production 2D pixel-art TILE ATLAS for a top-down parking-lot arcade game.
Primary request: one precisely aligned 4 columns by 4 rows sprite sheet, 16 equal square tiles, edge-to-edge no gutters, no margins. Canvas square 1024x1024, each tile exactly256x256. All tile cells completely filled opaque, no text/numbers/labels or grid separators. Classic chunky pixel art with dark navy outlines, weathered blue-gray asphalt, fresh green grass and light gray curbs. Authentic low-resolution pixel-art shapes, not realistic textures.
EXACT cell inventory, row-major, left to right:
ROW 1:
cell0 seamless dark desaturated blue-gray asphalt with only sparse subtle grain;
cell1 same asphalt with a cream parking-bay line along TOP edge only, width 3 percent cell;
cell2 same asphalt with cream L marking TOP and LEFT edges only;
cell3 same asphalt with cream reversed-L marking TOP and RIGHT edges only.
ROW 2:
cell4 upper-left corner of raised grass island: grass fills cell except light concrete curb 5percent along TOP and LEFT edges, rounded outer corner, asphalt beyond corner;
cell5 upper-right corner of same raised grass island with curb TOP and RIGHT;
cell6 middle left side of grass island: curb only along LEFT edge, grass everywhere else, NO top/bottom curb;
cell7 middle right side of grass island: curb only along RIGHT edge, grass everywhere else, NO top/bottom curb.
ROW 3:
cell8 lower-left island corner: concrete curb BOTTOM and LEFT;
cell9 lower-right island corner: concrete curb BOTTOM and RIGHT;
cell10 vertical chain-link mesh fence running TOP TO BOTTOM through CENTER of cell over asphalt, silver diamond mesh and dark posts, seamless at top/bottom;
cell11 same vertical chain-link fence matching cell10.
ROW 4:
cell12 horizontal chain-link mesh fence LEFT TO RIGHT across CENTER of cell over asphalt, silver diamond mesh and dark posts, seamless at left/right;
cell13 LEFT HALF of CLOSED two-leaf horizontal chain-link gate, mesh and silver frame aligned with cell12 fence, hinge left, meeting latch at RIGHT;
cell14 RIGHT HALF of same CLOSED gate, hinge right, latch at LEFT, aligned withcell13;
cell15 matching horizontal chain-link fence ascell12.
All fence tiles rendered straight overhead arcade convention with enough visible diamond mesh to read as chain link. No perspective vanishing points. Grass edges fit into a seamless TWO tiles wide FOUR tiles high island using row2 left/right top, row2 middle left/right repeated twice, row3 left/right bottom. Grass is traversable lawn, no bushes or objects.
The sheet is a raw texture for direct grid slicing, not a mockup. Keep EXACT four-by-four grid and consistent asphalt color throughout. No vehicles, bottles, people, shadows outside cells, no buildings.
